sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Penghuni
  actor Admin as Pengelola Gedung
  participant FE as Frontend UI (Web/Mobile)
  participant Maint as Modul Maintenance (Opsional)
  participant Room as Modul Room
  participant Bus as Internal Event Bus
  participant Notif as Modul Notification (Opsional)

  User->>FE: Input Tiket Komplain (Kamar, Deskripsi & Foto Kerusakan)
  FE->>Maint: POST /api/maintenance/reports (building_id, room_id, foto, deskripsi)
  
  Maint->>Maint: Simpan Tiket Kerusakan (status: 'open')
  Maint->>Bus: emit(DamageReportCreated)
  
  opt Jika Modul Notifikasi Aktif
    Bus->>Notif: handle(DamageReportCreated)
    Notif->>Admin: Kirim Notifikasi WhatsApp: Tiket Baru Masuk
  end
  
  Admin->>FE: Review Tiket & Evaluasi Tingkat Kerusakan
  
  opt Kerusakan Fatal (Fasilitas Kamar Rusak Berat)
    Admin->>Room: Update Status Fisik Kamar -> 'under_maintenance'
    Note over Room: Kamar sementara tidak dapat dialokasikan di Modul Schedule
  end
  
  Admin->>FE: Tugaskan Teknisi / Staf Penanganan
  FE->>Maint: PATCH /api/maintenance/reports/{id} (status: 'in_progress')
  
  Admin->>FE: Konfirmasi Perbaikan Selesai
  FE->>Maint: PATCH /api/maintenance/reports/{id} (status: 'resolved')
  Maint->>Bus: emit(MaintenanceResolved)
  
  opt Jika Kamar Sempat Di-nonaktifkan
    Maint->>Room: Kembalikan Status Fisik Kamar -> 'available'
  end
  
  opt Jika Modul Notifikasi Aktif
    Bus->>Notif: handle(MaintenanceResolved)
    Notif->>User: Kirim WhatsApp: Fasilitas Kamar Telah Selesai Diperbaiki
  end

